cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Evidex
message: If you use this repository, please cite it and the upstream FEVER dataset.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nebolisa
    given-names: Chimdumebi Mitchell
    alias: ChimdumebiNebolisa
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/ChimdumebiNebolisa/Evidex
abstract: >
  Evidex studies when designated gold evidence helps or harms LLM fact-checking
  on a 10,000-claim balanced FEVER sample, then decomposes evidence-induced
  regressions with blinded progressive-disclosure silver adjudication.
  Project code is MIT-licensed. FEVER and Wikipedia-derived data files are
  third-party material and are not relicensed by the MIT license.
  See docs/DATA_PROVENANCE.md.
keywords:
  - fact verification
  - FEVER
  - large language models
  - evidence utilization
  - silver adjudication
